y>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-- A run whose ToolPolicy does not request grep never probes and records\n-  nothing (the distinguishable not-configured state).\n+- A run whose tool selection contains neither grep nor glob never probes and\n+  records nothing (the distinguishable not-configured state).\n```\n\n</details>","id":"ca52a640b00da090fbac01f6da55ee429f20f844100d97ca9fe425bd231944c5","intervals":[[175,176]],"path":"src/driver/README.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Correct the rule for when the ripgrep probe runs."}],"head":"47090c6fb99d70c4768c9a086cb71439383e6d11","head_tree":"46873591f734edd9075598e36cb2f7298c8b4605","input_scope":[{"blob":"2ab23361bfe02d4fd85cef76942b65974988a556","intervals":[[1,596]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"job_id":"b4ca94db8feac2d5014ba8e376e66190d18f5c6e562a8d1f397404e6ee5628bf:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"2ab23361bfe02d4fd85cef76942b65974988a556","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/README.md","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"2ab23361bfe02d4fd85cef76942b65974988a556","intervals":[[396,396],[414,414]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"2ab23361bfe02d4fd85cef76942b65974988a556","intervals":[[396,396],[414,414]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"scope_digest":"21bbef669101a47dd1826f19142ea4147f0c9a69215117b41c8bd17ee761a77d","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-b4ca94db8feac2d5014ba8e376e66190d18f5c6e562a8d1f397404e6ee5628bf-g0-20261120T003225Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"b4ca94db8feac2d5014ba8e376e66190d18f5c6e562a8d1f397404e6ee5628bf","target":"f87bb4e94f3ea2867c8859eefbae915fe153556f","target_tree":"46873591f734edd9075598e36cb2f7298